## Workspace Composition Model

Every workspace shall be composed from six architectural layers.

### Layer 1 — Operational Objective

Every workspace exists to satisfy one primary institutional objective.

Examples include:

* Trade Markets
* Monitor Infrastructure
* Research Strategies
* Control Risk
* Executive Oversight
* Compliance Operations

The objective governs everything else.

