### Layer 3 — Capability Composition

The workspace assembles only governed capabilities.

Examples:

Trading Workspace

↓

Market Investigation

Portfolio

Execution

Watchlists

News

AI

Risk

Orders

Positions

Workspace behaviour emerges from capability composition rather than bespoke implementation.

